Two things in this repository are not covered by the licence above.

The three typefaces embedded in the binary — Archivo, Space Grotesk and
IBM Plex Mono — are each under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Their licence
texts ship in `assets/fonts/` and are reproduced there in full. The OFL permits
bundling them in a larger work; they remain under the OFL, not under the MIT
licence above. Run `breadify licences` for the list.

The Matvare Expressen wordmark, in `assets/matvare-expressen.svg` and drawn on
every printed sheet, is that company's own mark. It is used here with their
work and is not licensed to anyone by this file.
